    "why_it_matters": "A pruned candidate can score anywhere in [0.75, 0.80]. That is inside the review band, so it can be the assigned partner of a row and make it AMBIGUOUS, and it can be the runner-up of a review-band pair and change which unit is named in `candidates`. Neither is a MATCHED promotion, so neither is excluded by the lemma."
